### Llistar tots els productes
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products
Accept: application/json

### Obtenir producte per ID
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### ──────────────────────────────────
### OPERACIONS D'ESCRIPTURA
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Crear un producte nou
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Nous pelades",
  "price": 7.50,
  "description": "Nous pelades naturals 250g",
  "category": "Snacks",
  "stock": 60
}

### Crear un altre producte
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Galetes d'Avena",
  "price": 2.10,
  "description": "Galetes integrals d'avena 200g",
  "category": "Snacks",
  "stock": 95
}

### Actualitzar producte 1
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Poma Golden Premium",
  "price": 1.50,
  "description": "Poma dolça premium d'origen espanyol",
  "category": "Fruita",
  "stock": 120
}

### Actualitzar producte inexistent (esperar 404)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/products/999
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Fantasma",
  "price": 0.0,
  "description": "No existeixo",
  "category": "Res",
  "stock": 0
}

### Eliminar producte 5
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/5

### Eliminar producte inexistent (esperar 404)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/products/999

### ──────────────────────────────────
### TRANSACCIONS
### ──────────────────────────────────

### Transferir 10 unitats de stock del producte 1 al 2
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/transfer-stock?from=1&to=2&units=10

### Verificar stock del producte 1 (hauria de ser 10 menys)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json

### Verificar stock del producte 2 (hauria de ser 10 més)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/2
Accept: application/json

### Transferir stock impossible (més del disponible) — hauria de fallar
POST http://localhost:8080/api/products/transfer-stock?from=1&to=2&units=99999

### Verificar que el producte 1 no ha canviat (rollback)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/products/1
Accept: application/json
